    "body": "To do that simply clone the repo then `ln -s` with the wanted version:\r\n```shell\r\ngit clone https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax.git ~/.config/.nvim-minimax\r\nln -s ~/.config/.nvim-minimax/configs/nvim-0.11 ~/.config/nvim\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">To do that simply clone the repo then <code class=\"notranslate\">ln -s</code> with the wanted version:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax.git ~/.config/.nvim-minimax\nln -s ~/.config/.nvim-minimax/configs/nvim-0.11 ~/.config/nvim\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">git clone https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax.git <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.config/.nvim-minimax\nln -s <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.config/.nvim-minimax/configs/nvim-0.11 <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.config/nvim</pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "To do that simply clone the repo then ln -s with the wanted version:\ngit clone https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax.git ~/.config/.nvim-minimax\nln -s ~/.config/.nvim-minimax/configs/nvim-0.11 ~/.config/nvim",
