            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That's one possibility, yes. One big problem here is no (easy) possibility for customization of plugins used in MiniMax. As they would introduce Git conflicts.\r\n\r\nMaybe a separate \"reference\" config in '~/.config/nvim-minimax' that is linked to a fixed reference config is a better compromise for this sort of usage.",
